@comment{References of the adaptive radiotherapy DIR project. UTF-8. Checked on 2026-11-21.

Only the sources cited in README.md and docs/ are listed.

Custom fields, ignored by BibTeX and biblatex styles:
  usedfor   = where the source is cited or used in the repository, and for what.
  verified  = how the bibliographic record was checked. Vocabulary:
    PDF first page: authors, title, venue or arXiv identifier read on the first page of the paper.
    Crossref: DOI, venue, volume and pages from the Crossref record, title and first author matching.
    DataCite: record of the DOI on DataCite (arXiv and Zenodo DOIs), title and first author matching.

DOIs and arXiv identifiers are given only when verified.}

